  "query_preview": "..\n(Wednesday through next Monday)\nIssued at 1037 PM CDT Sun Aug 30 2026\n\nThe heat looks to peak on Wednesday but conditions will remain hot\ninto the end of the week. Highs will remain in the mid to upper\n90s for much of the area with heat index values as hot as 107. A\nlow level CAP looks to remain in place keeping rain chances very\nlow. The upper level ridge will break down late week into the\nweekend and build back west. This will bring some cooling starting\nFriday with additional cooling over the weekend. As the ridge\nbreaks down rain chances will increase slightly but overall\nforcing will be weak keeping the chances low.",
